<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Noose Trap -->
  <DRNTF_NooseTrap.label>绞索陷阱</DRNTF_NooseTrap.label>
  <!-- EN: Kurin's special noose trap that can be quickly made with a small amount of ingredients. When the trap is activated, a noose binds the enemy's legs. It has no effect on large enemies and mechanoids. -->
  <DRNTF_NooseTrap.description>魅狐的特殊绞索陷阱，只需少量材料即可快速制成。激活陷阱后，套索会束缚敌人的腿。它对大型敌人和机械单位没有效果。</DRNTF_NooseTrap.description>
  
</LanguageData>